can go in and, like you said,

00:38:07.442 --> 00:38:09.650
it's got all the built-in
things, especially G Cloud.

00:38:09.650 --> 00:38:12.360
So you can run those commands,
and you're good to go.

00:38:12.360 --> 00:38:14.990
But it's also the
pseudo-temporary, right?

00:38:14.990 --> 00:38:16.970
Like, environment
changes won't persist.

00:38:16.970 --> 00:38:20.180
So if you install Terraform
and then you come back later,

00:38:20.180 --> 00:38:21.230
Terraform might be gone.

00:38:21.230 --> 00:38:23.840
So it's not really
